  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given system of equations</p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math><br />has no solution,&nbsp;<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Mat